{"version":1,"content":"<p>玩家近日在Windows 1.0一份長期不顯眼的製作名單中發現Gabe Newell的姓名，為他參與微軟早期Windows開發提供了直接佐證。這段微軟任職經歷早已為人所知，新發現僅限於這份名單證據。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586282.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.842512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:58:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"03f95a53685a44f668463d4e4c4457520737918ecd8dfed3a70b798202aa4302","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}